", "tlg_author": "0540", "tlg_work": "021", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἔφευγε ταῖς ναυσὶν εὖ πλεούσαις X. HG 1.6.16", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τριήρης ταχὺ π. Id. Oec. 8.8", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". of other things, swim, float,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τεύχεα καλὰ . . πλῶον καὶ νέκυες Il. 21.302", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "δένδρεα . . , τά οἱ πλώοιεν ἐλαφρῶς Od. 5.240", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ["}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "νῆσοσ] πλέουσα Hdt. 2.156", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". to be conveyed by sea, ["}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "σκῦλα] πλέοντα Th. 3.114", "author_abbreviation": "Th.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". metaph., ταύτης ἔπι πλέοντες ὀρθῆς while [the ship of] our country bearing us is on an even keel,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "S. Ant. 190", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; οὐδ' ὅπως ὀρθὴ πλεύσεται (sc. ἡ πόλις)"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "προείδετο D. 19.250", "author_abbreviation": "D.", "tlg_author": "0014", "tlg_work": "019", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "πάντα ἡμῖν κατ' ὀρθὸν πλεῖ Pl. Lg. 813d", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "034", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "θεοῦ θέλοντος κἂν ἐπὶ ῥιπὸς πλέοις E. Fr. 397", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; also"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "κέρδους ἕκατι κἂν ἐπὶ ῥιπὸς πλέοι Ar. Pax 699", "author_abbreviation": "Ar.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". (With πλἑvʼ-, πλευ- cf. Skt. plávate 'float', 'swim', Lat. pluit; with πλω- cf. Goth. flōdus 'river', 'flood', O"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "E.", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "flćwan 'flow'.)"}]}